Something I've found that I haven't seen anybody blab yet:
  A good use for a tinning kit:  It keeps Troll and Olog-Hai corpses from
regenerating back up from death.  They're pretty tasty, too (snerk!).

And about that person who was trapped behind the pet and the cursed item:
You could a) Tport, if you can, b) Tport the dog, if you can, or c) wait for a
monster to come and pick up the item (and maybe wax your dog) or just d) wait
for your dog to starve to death, and eat him, too!                             

